OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,6,     F4/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,7,     FMendelssohn's grand tour through
OL,8,     FVenice, Rome and Naples.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FPetroc Trelawny welcomes composer
OL,11,     FErland Cooper to the In Tune
OL,12,     Fstudio to discuss the upcoming
OL,13,     FUltimate Calm Late Night Prom, and
OL,14,     Fwe talk to pianist Vikingur
OL,15,     FOlafsson.
OL,16,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,17,     FLive at the BBC Proms: Miho Hazama
OL,18,     Fand the BBC Concert Orchestra are
OL,19,     Fjoined by trumpeter Ambrose
OL,20,     FAkinmusire in a tribute to the
OL,21,     Fjazz legend in his centenary year.
